<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <header class="section-head"><span class="section-num">03 / Questions</span><h2 class="section-title">A few things <em>parents ask.</em></h2></header>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details><summary>Which campus should I choose?</summary><p>If your child is 3 – 7 and you'd like a calmer, smaller-group experience, choose <strong>Prakriti (Sec 22)</strong>'s Slow Summers. If your child is 3 – 10 (or you want swimming, climbing, skateboarding, transport and day-care included), choose the <strong>Prakriti (Sec 128)</strong> Summer Jamboree.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do my child and I have to be Prakriti families to attend?</summary><p>Not at all. Both campuses welcome children from any school across Noida, Greater Noida, and Delhi NCR. Prakriti families get a ₹500 discount on registration.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is transportation provided?</summary><p>Yes, at Prakriti (Sec 128) — transport is included in the programme fee. At Prakriti (Sec 22), transport is not provided (parents drop and pick up).</p></details>
